LAMMPS (10 Dec 2025)
units real
atom_style full

boundary p p p

pair_style lj/cut 12.0

bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style zero nocoeff
improper_style harmonic

special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.5

read_data equilibrated.data
